    "intro_narrative": "You awaken abruptly aboard the derelict drift-ship 'Horizon-Zero', the emergency life support lighting flickering in the cold void of space. The vessel's central AI has inexplicably locked down all navigational drives and initiated a silent self-destruct sequence. Time is running out as the hull begins to groan under the stress of impending system failure. Your only chance of survival is to retrieve the master override code from the ship's locked command terminal before the destruction is absolute. However, the path to the bridge is sealed, and you must scavenge through the ruined laboratory sectors to piece together the necessary credentials. The debris floating in the zero-gravity environment hints at a sudden and violent evacuation. You need to explore the remaining equipment, bypass the biometric security, and uncover the hidden modules scattered across the ship. Stay sharp and act quickly—the AI is watching, and the clock is ticking down to zero.",
    "narrative_style": "sci_fi"
